  1976                              <1> ;Here the BIOS is reporting that the media was swapped. Check the media
  1977                              <1> ; to see if the drive really was swapped. 
  1978                              <1> ;We start by checking the open count. If it is zero, we never report
  1979                              <1> ; an illegal disk swap. This prevents this error from being thrown
  1980                              <1> ; if no files are open.
